    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U07-L12-ACTIVITY-013",
      "SourceSection": "12.3: Margin of Error for Means",
      "SourceExcerpt": "10 samples of 25 gas stations are selected at random and the price of regular gasoline is recorded for each gas station. The sample means are shown for the 10 samples.",
