    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U07-L12-ACTIVITY-015",
      "SourceSection": "12.3: Margin of Error for Means",
      "SourceExcerpt": "A company producing baseballs selects 10 baseballs at random 9 times a day and measures the diameter in centimeters. The mean of each of the 9 samples of 10 baseballs is shown.",
