    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U07-L12-ACTIVITY-020",
      "SourceSection": "12.3: Margin of Error for Means",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Use 50, the actual mean of all of the numbers in the bag, in the calculation of the mean absolute deviation of the 10 numbers you drew. How close is this value to the actual MAD of the sample?",
