      "SourceSection": "12.3: Margin of Error for Means",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The mean difference of the sample means is 0.095 seconds (0.095 seconds ahead of the atomic clock time), and the standard deviation of the sample means is 2.791 seconds. The company should expect that the mean difference between the clock…",
